{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ad7ad1ab973de9f2","name":"Rik's Cantina","source":{"id":"source:reference-ad7ad1ab973de9f2","title":"Rik's Cantina","revision":24699,"timestamp":"2024-11-05T19:37:52Z","sha256":"09f06be019e028381f63cfe4fd3c443484e87eb8bf31c7815fea7793d26e3d9c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24699","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Rik%27s%20Cantina&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ad7ad1ab973de9f2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Rik's Cantina is a well-known underworld bar and meeting place on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"},". Located near the government districts, Rik's is hidden deep in the lower levels of the city-planet. Even approaching the dive is dangerous, especially if one takes a route through the failed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," terraforming areas, where the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vongspawn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vongspawn"}," survivors eke out a meager existence. Even close to the cantina, those traveling alone or who appear to be weak become targets for local gangs and thugs looking for a quick score of credits. Despite its rough neighborhood, or perhaps because of it, Rik's is very popular. Virtually any drink or other recreational activity can be found here, for a price. While that alone would make the place popular locally, what really draws offworlders is the quality of the information trade and excellent connections that can be found here. It is also well known that fighting is not allowed, making it a safe place to talk, unlike the surrounding area.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The cantina's owner, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutt","referenceId":"reference:38066b70aa2676d9"}," named ",{"tag":"a","children":["Queen Jool"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Queen_Jool","referenceId":"reference:17c10efeda3a0343"},", makes this all possible. She facilitates much of the information trade herself. She takes every opportunity to obtain new information, whether that means gathering it through spies, exchanging it for other information, or simply bargaining for it. Any information she obtains goes into her extensive database. Even when she's not actually in the cantina herself, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Queen Jool"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Queen_Jool","referenceId":"reference:17c10efeda3a0343"}," is usually available, as she lives in a swamp situated under the premises.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Rik's Cantina Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Finn, Bartender"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Finn,_Bartender","referenceId":"reference:682201b0c008da02"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jak","referenceId":"reference:e1cd58d44ad9eee4"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Queen Jool"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Queen_Jool","referenceId":"reference:17c10efeda3a0343"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 9\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
